### IPP-1724 Interview Mode API (setup, start, save answers, finish, report, history, delete)
### Needs the JS problems imported (IPP-1715) and Q&A content. Put passwords while testing, then CHANGE_ME back.
### Part A uses the admin (full access). Part B uses a NORMAL unpaid user (one free round).
### Run the steps in order. Restarting the server once creates the new indexes (autoIndex).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = askedin143@gmail.com
@adminPassword = changeme
@userEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp2@gmail.com
@userPassword = NayaPassword123
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.data.token}}
@roundId = {{start.response.body.data._id}}
@trialRoundId = {{trialStart.response.body.data._id}}


### ==== A. Paid / admin ====

### A1. Admin login -> 200
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }


### A2. Without login -> 401 "Please log in to continue"
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/setup


### A3. Setup -> 200, every active language with access "full",
###     javascript format { qa: 3, coding: 1 } minutes 19, php format { qa: 4, coding: 0 } minutes 12,
###     levels [junior, mid, senior], running null
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### A4. Wrong level -> 400 "Level must be junior, mid or senior"
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "javascript", "level": "expert" }


### A5. Start JS Mid -> 201 "Interview started", 4 items:
###     0-2 kind "qa" (easy, medium, hard if they exist; easiest first; different topics when possible),
###     each with question, answer, topic { slug, name }, seconds 180, rating null
###     3 kind "coding", problem WITHOUT hints / solution, total = number of tests, seconds 600
###     timeLimit 1140, isTrial false
# @name start
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "javascript", "level": "mid" }


### A6. Start again while it runs -> 409, code ROUND_IN_PROGRESS
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php", "level": "junior" }


### A7. Setup again -> running { _id = this round, language JavaScript, level mid }
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### A8. Q1 "knew" -> 200 "Saved", item.points 1, answered 1 of 4
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/items/0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": "knew" }


### A9. Q2 "partly" -> 200, item.points 0.5, answered 2
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": "partly" }


### A10. Wrong rating -> 400 "Rate your answer: knew, partly, didnt or skipped"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/items/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": "maybe" }


### A11. Coding item without code -> 400 "Send the code and the number of passed tests"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/items/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": "knew" }


### A12. Coding: 2 tests passed -> 200, item.passed 2, points = 2 / total
###      (passed above total is cut down to total)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/items/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "function x() { return 1; }", "passed": 2 }


### A13. Item that is not in the round -> 404 "Question not found in this round"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/items/7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": "knew" }


### A14. Running round (reload) -> 200, status "in-progress", items with the saved ratings / code
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### A15. Finish -> 200 "Round finished", status "completed",
###      Q3 (not answered) rating "skipped" points 0,
###      percentage = round((1 + 0.5 + 0 + 2/total) / 4 * 100)  e.g. total 6 -> 46,
###      coding item has solution { code, explanation }, solutionLocked false,
###      studyNext: Q3 topic (skipped), Q2 topic (partly) with "questions" count, the coding problem
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### A16. Finish again -> 200 "Round already finished", same report
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### A17. Save after finish -> 409, code ROUND_FINISHED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}/items/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": "knew" }


### A18. Report (reload) -> 200, same as A15
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### A19. History -> stats { rounds 1, averagePercentage = A15 percentage, weakestTopic (kind, language, topic, averagePercentage) },
###      rounds[0] = this round (language name / slug / icon, level, percentage)
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### A20. PHP (no coding problems) Senior -> 201, 4 items, all kind "qa", timeLimit 720
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php", "level": "senior" }


### A21. Delete the running PHP round (cancel) -> copy its _id from A20 -> 200 "Round deleted from your history"
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/interview/PUT_PHP_ROUND_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### A22. Bad id -> 400 "Invalid round id"
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==== B. Unpaid user (one free round) ====
### To test B again later, reset the free round in MongoDB:
###   db.users.updateOne({ email: "arsalmustafa62+ipp2@gmail.com" }, { $unset: { interviewTrialAt: 1 } })

### B1. User login -> 200
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{userEmail}}", "password": "{{userPassword}}" }


### B2. Setup -> languages access "trial", format counts only free content
###     (Q&A of the FIRST topic, free problems), trial { used false, roundId null }
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Purana round khatam karo
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/6ae3247f472b51216c328135/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### B3. Start the free round -> 201 "Free interview round started", isTrial true,
###     every Q&A from the first topic, coding problem is a free one
# @name trialStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/start
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "javascript", "level": "junior" }


### B4. Finish it -> 200, coding item solution null, solutionLocked true
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{trialRoundId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### B5. Setup -> every language access "locked", available false, trial { used true, usedAt, roundId = B3 round }
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### B6. Second round -> 403, code INTERVIEW_TRIAL_USED
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/start
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "php", "level": "junior" }


### B7. Trial report still opens -> 200, status "completed"
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{trialRoundId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### B8. Another user's round -> 404 "Round not found"
GET {{baseUrl}}/interview/{{roundId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### B9. Clear history -> 200 "Interview history cleared (1 round)"
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/interview/history
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


### B10. Start again after deleting -> still 403 INTERVIEW_TRIAL_USED (the free round stays used)
POST {{baseUrl}}/interview/start
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "javascript", "level": "junior" }


### ==== C. Clean up (admin) ====

### C1. Clear admin history -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/interview/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
